    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01J99ADSD0TF9T6ZD21TBXY0DY\">You will learn</h2><p>Learn how to update your account's billing address or billing email address.</p><h2 id=\"h_01J99ADSD1Z6HF50MYVH93741S\">Before you begin</h2><p>Only <a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005231648\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">account Owners and Admins</a> can update the billing address or billing email address.</p><p>You can only set 1 email address to receive billing notifications, and it defaults to the Owner's email address. If you need multiple people at your organization to receive notifications, we recommend creating an email alias and using that as your billing contact. Alternatively, <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115001002272\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">contact our support team</a> for assistance.</p><p>By default, your invoices will be addressed to your <em>Company/organization name </em>(configurable in <strong>Settings &gt; Account &gt; Organization &gt; Contact Information</strong>) unless you provide a <em>Billing organization name</em>. Updates to your <em>Company/organization name </em>will be reflected on subsequent invoices.</p><p>For more information on billing, see <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000976672\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Understanding how Klaviyo billing works</a>.</p><h2 id=\"h_01J99ADSD182X1EX7AWR7CF8CJ\">Change your billing address</h2><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e7f8b1a65b221e54a969ef2bf6666dfb1\">Select your organization name in the bottom left corner.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e1a6877bee5203ebb9c072fb42bc88945\">Choose <strong>Billing</strong> from the dropdown menu. <br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/31422152988571\" alt=\"The organization name selected from the bottom left corner of Klaviyo and showing Billing being clicked on from the list of navigation options.\" width=\"278\" height=\"262\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e2e33b3fa7ad2b02459f1e1ce3b916554\">Click<strong> Preferences</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/31422152988955\" alt=\"The Billing Settings page showing the Preferences tab being selected from the side menu.\" width=\"275\" height=\"273\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee264ccc758e514c3fa8bd26af28ba04d\">Scroll to the <em>Billing address </em>section.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/31422136269979\" alt=\"The Billing address card on the Billing Preferences page showing an example account's address details.\" width=\"541\" height=\"472\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ec45ec86f0a2eadf137e6d65d038fd024\">Input your <em>Billing organization name</em>.<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e570150b69726c00efa3b91b8986c8d65\">After saving this change, your <em>Billing organization name </em>will be shown on your future invoices.<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e629d47c5c5e728c4086288fa195b5cb9\">If you do not enter a <em>Billing organization name, </em>or you delete the name you entered, your future invoices will show your <em>Company/organization name.</em>\n</li></ul>\n</li></ul>\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e8548a3376bed5d5c06d39d1bc4958a6b\">From here, you can either:<ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee73e867722379968e99c6d8b76384803\">Check the box to <strong>Use same address as my organization's contact information</strong>.<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e5d900ad8e392d27fdbcc4dfff7bc6a9f\">Note that your organization's address is configured on the <em>Organization</em> settings page (navigate to <strong>Settings &gt; Account &gt; Organization</strong>).</li></ul>\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ef7d7c4d2222300495a5a50961b05af4d\">Manually input a the details for a different billing address.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ef6596551c02f625f15b41997ba9cfd35\">Select <strong>Update billing address</strong>.</li>\n</ol><p>If successfully saved, you will see a notification indicating that this billing address has been updated.</p><h2 id=\"h_01J99C3RSXBKQ295BMBAJWVJTN\">Update your billing email address</h2><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e68ed52a726ed0438b413c3cadfe83262\">Select your organization name in the bottom left corner.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e11bf0290a545875601d8adf08f9432e7\">Choose <strong>Billing</strong> from the dropdown menu.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/31422152988571\" alt=\"The organization name selected from the bottom left corner of Klaviyo and showing Billing being clicked on from the list of navigation options.\" width=\"274\" height=\"258\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e85a2cb1eabe0c17703c6adb4bdffb332\">Click<strong> Preferences</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/31422152988955\" alt=\"The Billing Settings page showing the Preferences tab being selected from the side menu.\" width=\"275\" height=\"273\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e10ca494461698a8b7b794888c9326e40\">Scroll to the <em>Billing email </em>section.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e38940d432e19d80a83235370e0901f23\">Input the new email address under <em>Send billing notifications to</em>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/31422152989467\" alt=\"The Billing email card on the Billing Preferences page showing an example account's billing email address\" width=\"675\" height=\"194\">\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e74ad1625f25df0811c54b000cafb2542\">Click <strong>Update billing email</strong>.</li>\n</ol><p>Once successfully saved, you will see a notification indicating that this email address has been updated. That email address will remain in Klaviyo and any future billing notifications will be sent to this contact.</p><h2 id=\"h_01J99ADSD13ZRW5NPJYFJXFX3K\">Additional resources</h2><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ed386f1268fb0b163a5f28d107b8c2bad\"><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115005078987\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to view your account's payment history</a></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e32037033d5a710ddbc3ef5e86239f970\"><a href=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/115000976672\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Understand how Klaviyo billing works</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
